test-execution	Test hive.mjs execution	2026-08-11T16:50:19.9556946Z                                              just that tier. Bare flag means "so
test-execution	Test hive.mjs execution	2026-08-11T16:50:19.9557149Z                                             nnet-fable". The idea: iterate cheap
test-execution	Test hive.mjs execution	2026-08-11T16:50:19.9557353Z                                             ly first so expensive models do more
